# Prompt Management

Do not place all behavior inside one uncontrolled prompt string.

Separate prompts into: core system identity, voice/tone, business rules, safety, conversation flow, tool usage, customer context, retrieved knowledge, current call state.

Prompt content must be versioned and testable.

The agent must:

- Ask one question at a time
- Avoid unnecessarily long spoken answers
- Never invent business information
- Confirm critical details before executing actions
- Repeat dates, times, phone numbers, and names when confirmation is required
- Clearly state when information is unavailable
- Escalate according to configured handoff rules
